Communication Barriers

Communication Complexity:
- No barrier → 0
- Language barrier → 1
- Hearing/visual impairment → 1
- Family translator required → 2

--------------------------------------------
Family/Social Complexity:
- Minimal → 0
- Occasional support needed → 1
- High-demand family → 2
- Conflict / end-of-life / constant presence → 3
---------------------------------------------

Turnover Risk:
- Stable → 0
- Possible transfer → 1
- Discharge/transfer today → 2
- Admission today → 3

---------------------------------------------
Safety Risk:
- None → 0
- Fall risk → 1
- High fall risk / impulsive → 2
- Requires sitter/restraints → 3-4

----------------------------------------------

Patient Behaviour / Cooperation:

- Fully Cooperative
  Calm, respectful, follows instructions, no redirection
  → Score: 0

- Mildly Challenging
  Occasional anxiety, repetitive questions, needs reassurance
  → Score: 1

- Moderately Difficult
  Frequent complaints, demanding, poor compliance,
  emotionally labile, delays care
  → Score: 2

- Highly Difficult / Disruptive
  Verbal aggression, refusal of care, confusion/delirium,
  constant calling, unsafe behaviour (pulling lines)
  → Score: 3

- Extreme / Unsafe
  Physical aggression, requires restraints or sitter,
  actively endangering staff/self
  → Score: 4

